      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْصَارٌ</span></b>  <i>That in which a thing is put and pressed,
in order that its water,</i> or <i>the like, may flow</i> [or
<i>ooze</i>] <i>out.</i> (K, * TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْصَرٌ</span>.]

